cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Magnuson: CME detection from Aditya-L1 MAG magnetometer data"
authors:
  - name: "Arinjay"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aur1ety/Magnuson"
abstract: >-
  Coronal Mass Ejection detector for in-situ magnetometer data from the
  Aditya-L1 MAG instrument, using a PatchTransformer (ViT-style patch
  attention for time series) over 9 physics-informed magnetic-field features,
  with XGBoost and LightGBM baselines.
keywords:
  - coronal mass ejection
  - space weather
  - Aditya-L1
  - magnetometer
  - machine learning
